cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use WattSign, cite this software, the software version or commit, and the relevant datasets and methods."
type: software
title: "WattSign: Electrical Signatures for Appliance Recognition"
authors:
  - name: "Harkgreen"
    email: "ruizhang.eric@gmail.com"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Electrical signal processing and causal models for appliance recognition
  from aggregate power and voltage-current measurements. Five experiments
  cover UK-DALE, TDHA and PLAID, with training workflows, evaluation metrics,
  NPU training results, CUDA supplemental evaluation and CPU weight conversion.
keywords:
  - non-intrusive load monitoring
  - appliance recognition
  - electrical signatures
  - causal time series
  - energy digitalization
